### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects
Accept: application/json

### Get project by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects?id=1
Accept: application/json

### Add project
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "E-Commerce",
  "description": "Online shopping application"
}
